<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.87 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.87 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 12.0 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.87	(6.90)    98.42	  (98.31)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.80	(6.80)    96.77	  (96.72)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.68	(6.63)    93.80	  (93.80)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on November 26.</p>
</text>
